@ref s 488.02(6) (src:9909)
GIVEN `the judge considers it necessary to examine the document to determine whether it should be disclosed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 488.02(6) the judge may examine the document` MEANS
    IF `the judge considers it necessary to examine the document to determine whether it should be disclosed`
