DECLARE `s 488.02(7) order` IS ONE OF
    `s 488.02(7)(a) the document is returned to the journalist or the media outlet`
    `s 488.02(7)(b) the document is delivered to the officer who gave the notice, subject to such restrictions and conditions as the judge deems appropriate`

-- covers: 488.02(7), 488.02(7)(a), 488.02(7)(b)
-- jural: a journalist > the judge > right
-- src:9911 | (7) The judge must,
-- src:9912 | (a) if he or she is of the opinion that the document should not be disclosed, order that it be returned to the journalist or the media outlet, as the case may be; or
-- src:9913 | (b) if he or she is of the opinion that the document should be disclosed, order that it be delivered to the officer who gave the notice under subsection (2), subject to such restrictions and conditions as the judge deems appropriate.
@ref s 488.02(7) (src:9911-9913)
GIVEN `the judge is of the opinion that the document should not be disclosed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the judge is of the opinion that the document should be disclosed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 488.02(7) order`
`s 488.02(7) the order the judge must make` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the judge is of the opinion that the document should not be disclosed` AND NOT `the judge is of the opinion that the document should be disclosed` THEN JUST `s 488.02(7)(a) the document is returned to the journalist or the media outlet`
        IF `the judge is of the opinion that the document should be disclosed` AND NOT `the judge is of the opinion that the document should not be disclosed` THEN JUST `s 488.02(7)(b) the document is delivered to the officer who gave the notice, subject to such restrictions and conditions as the judge deems appropriate`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent)
